[[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238813\">7040B22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238809\">7040B15</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238814\">7040B28</a></p><p><strong>- 7040L44 rear compartment scuff strip - r r</strong></p><p><a href=\"#/3238928\">7050A47</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238816\">7040B30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238807\">7040B06</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the winder retaining bolt.</p><p>2. Move the seat belt winder.</p><p>3. Undo the bolts (3a) and nuts (3b) securing the bracket.</p><p>4. Remove the bracket.</p><p>5. \n                                          If necessary, remove the striker (see op. \n                                          <a href=\"#/3238927\">7050A45</a>\n                                           )</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019527.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,65536,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the bracket is not damaged.</p><p>Fit the bracket in position and fix it\nwith the nuts and bolts.</p><p>Fit the winder in position and fix it using\nthe bolt.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR SEAT BELT REEL.</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4.0</p></td></tr></table></div><p>If removed, refit the striker (see op. \n\n                                          <a href=\"#/3238927\">7050A45</a>\n                                           )</p><p><a href=\"#/3238807\">7040B06</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238816\">7040B30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238928\">7050A47</a></p><p><strong>- 7040L44 rear compartment scuff strip - r r</strong></p><p><a href=\"#/3238814\">7040B28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238809\">7040B15</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238813\">7040B22</a></p>"]]